<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Solves the exact Thomas (1975) / Murray (1981) homogeneous steady state (u0, v0) = (9.9338, 9.2892), Jacobian J0, critical diffusivity ratio d_c = 9.6292, and dispersion curve sigma(gamma*k^2) (L95-166); numerically integrates the curvilinear Laplace-Beltrami PDE on a tapered conical tail (L216-291) demonstrating proximal 2D spots (m >= 1) transitioning to distal 1D rings (m = 0) past r_crit = 0.7527; integrates the 2D planar Neumann PDE with Liu, Liaw & Maini (2006) Stage-2 rosette opening (L298-358); and backs all three mathematical laws with machine-checked Lean 4 proofs in `Loop_003_mammalian_coat_markings.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L581-647) extracts 8 reference-backed quantitative morphometrics covering steady-state u0 = 9.9338, critical diffusivity ratio d_c = 9.6292, critical wavenumber gamma*k_c^2 = 0.7442, conical tail cutoff radius r_crit = 0.7527, proximal-to-distal circumferential spot suppression ratio (865.5x), scale sweep correlation (Pearson r = 0.9999, p = 2.6e-7), negative-control amplitude quenching (std_u = 5.0e-10 at d=1 and 4.4e-16 at K=0), and segmented *Panthera pardus* inter-rosette Delaunay wavelength CV (0.2966 vs 0.24 reference)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
